# Source: https://github.com/wellmanifest/lifecycle
# Revision: 1ea2a90bd5b90a768ad2b36a9c1c330523bc80b4
# Compatibility projection; domain conformance remains authoritative.

LIFECYCLE governed-ticket VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Bounded ticket from allocation through publication, blocking and closure"
STATE UNALLOCATED INITIAL
STATES [ALLOCATED, PLANNED, AUTHORIZED, EDITING, VALIDATING, PUBLICATION, BLOCKED]
STATE DONE TERMINAL
EVENTS [ALLOCATE, PLAN, AUTHORIZE, EDIT, VALIDATE, PUBLISH, CLOSE, BLOCK, CHECKPOINT, RESUME]
EVIDENCES [ALLOCATION_PROOF, BOUNDED_INTENT, SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION, ACCEPTED_BASE, VALIDATION_EVIDENCE, REVIEWABLE_PUBLICATION, TRUSTED_INTEGRATION, BLOCKER_EVIDENCE, BLOCKER_RESOLUTION, WORK_CONTINUITY_RECEIPT]
TRANSITION UNALLOCATED -> ALLOCATED ON ALLOCATE REQUIRES ALLOCATION_PROOF
TRANSITION ALLOCATED -> PLANNED ON PLAN REQUIRES BOUNDED_INTENT
TRANSITION PLANNED -> AUTHORIZED ON AUTHORIZE REQUIRES SESSION_EXECUTION_AUTHORIZATION
TRANSITION AUTHORIZED -> EDITING ON EDIT REQUIRES ACCEPTED_BASE
TRANSITION EDITING -> VALIDATING ON VALIDATE REQUIRES VALIDATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION VALIDATING -> PUBLICATION ON PUBLISH REQUIRES REVIEWABLE_PUBLICATION
TRANSITION PUBLICATION -> DONE ON CLOSE REQUIRES TRUSTED_INTEGRATION
TRANSITION [ALLOCATED, PLANNED, AUTHORIZED, EDITING, VALIDATING, PUBLICATION] -> BLOCKED ON BLOCK REQUIRES BLOCKER_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION AUTHORIZED -> AUTHORIZED ON CHECKPOINT REQUIRES WORK_CONTINUITY_RECEIPT
TRANSITION EDITING -> EDITING ON CHECKPOINT REQUIRES WORK_CONTINUITY_RECEIPT
TRANSITION VALIDATING -> VALIDATING ON CHECKPOINT REQUIRES WORK_CONTINUITY_RECEIPT
TRANSITION PUBLICATION -> PUBLICATION ON CHECKPOINT REQUIRES WORK_CONTINUITY_RECEIPT
TRANSITION BLOCKED -> BLOCKED ON CHECKPOINT REQUIRES WORK_CONTINUITY_RECEIPT
TRANSITION BLOCKED -> PLANNED ON RESUME REQUIRES BLOCKER_RESOLUTION
END
